{"code":"PK04","wikidata":"Q13021845","wikipedia":{"en":"Samakkhi MRT station","th":"สถานีสามัคคี"},"summary":{"en":"Samakkhi station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Tiwanon Road at the junction between Tiwanon and Samakkhi roads in Mueang Nonthaburi district, Nonthaburi province. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีสามัคคี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนติวานนท์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองนนทบุรี จังหวัดนนทบุรี"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Samakkhi_Station_20231125-4.